    <briefdescription>
<para>Heuristic <ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_i_l_l_m_scorer" kindref="compound">ILLMScorer</ref> that approximates perplexity via term overlap. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Computes the Jaccard similarity between query tokens and document tokens as a lightweight proxy for LLM log-likelihood. Used when no real LLM scorer is injected; provides a deterministic, reproducible baseline.</para>
<para>Performance: O(|query| + |document|). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
